WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.376 --> 00:00:03.626
Unit one. Everyday Greetings!

2
00:00:04.593 --> 00:00:13.171
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Chanthy. Welcome to C2-EPE Master English, Beginner level!

3
00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:17.380
Hi, Teacher Chanthy! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:21.200
Today we learn: Everyday Greetings. Let's go!

5
00:00:21.898 --> 00:00:25.365
Hello. Say it with me. Hello!

6
00:00:28.931 --> 00:00:32.848
Good morning. Say it with me. Good morning!

7
00:00:36.331 --> 00:00:40.948
Nice to meet you. Say it with me. Nice to meet you!

8
00:00:44.388 --> 00:00:47.571
Name. Say it with me. Name!

9
00:00:51.077 --> 00:00:55.127
Introduce. Say it with me. Introduce!

10
00:00:58.607 --> 00:01:02.391
Friendly. Say it with me. Friendly!

11
00:01:05.918 --> 00:01:09.801
Handshake. Say it with me. Handshake!

12
00:01:13.273 --> 00:01:16.940
Goodbye. Say it with me. Goodbye!

13
00:01:20.462 --> 00:01:23.862
Greet. Say it with me. Greet!

14
00:01:27.362 --> 00:01:31.028
Polite. Say it with me. Polite!

15
00:01:34.528 --> 00:01:43.549
Grammar time! be + adjective. Listen. I am friendly. She is nice.

16
00:01:43.599 --> 00:01:49.085
Your turn. Say it with me. I am friendly. She is nice.

17
00:01:53.796 --> 00:02:02.449
Hello! Nice to meet you. My name is Dara. Let's introduce ourselves and shake hands like friendly people do.

18
00:02:02.499 --> 00:02:04.025
I like this story!

19
00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:10.130
Look! What's the word?

20
00:02:10.180 --> 00:02:11.702
Nice to meet you!

21
00:02:12.755 --> 00:02:18.169
Look! What's the word?

22
00:02:18.219 --> 00:02:19.369
Handshake!

23
00:02:20.423 --> 00:02:28.568
Think and answer. How do you greet someone new in your culture?

24
00:02:28.618 --> 00:02:29.768
Great answer!

25
00:02:30.890 --> 00:02:35.239
Great work today! See you next time. Goodbye!

26
00:02:35.289 --> 00:02:36.908
Goodbye, everyone!

